      "writtenOn": "2025-03-04T11:56:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When ```isEnabled``` is set to ```true```, the equalizers add gain to the input signal. Therefore, we regenerate the sine input based on the gain dB to prevent it from exceeding the full-scale dB level.",
      "parentUuid": "7a5ba666_bd3c9d54",
